// scorch of soot on the ground (permanent: the ground keeps a burn mark when it catches), a heat glow, glowing coals, layered flame tongues (red, orange, yellow) that flicker and sway, smoke that climbs and drifts, rising
// sparks, and a light (gfxEmit) that the bloom and the night pick up. It smoulders when it is warned (small flames, a dim scorch, the dashed ring), catches with a burst of sparks and a puff, burns full, dies down to coals
